\pard\sa120\fs23\b Backend Code\b0\par
\pard\sa120\fs22 The backend source code is mainly contained in app.py. It creates the Flask application, connects to SQLite, manages authentication, serves templates, exposes API endpoints, and generates timetables. wsgi.py exposes the application for deployment with Gunicorn.\par
