\pard\sa180\fs22 The complete implementation is available in the project folders templates, static/css, static/js, and in the backend files app.py and wsgi.py.\par
\pard\sa180\fs24\b Conclusion\b0\par
\pard\sa180\fs22 The proposed College Timetable Management System reduces manual effort, improves timetable consistency, centralizes academic resource data, and gives students and faculty convenient access to published schedules.\par
